Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:47:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): expose thread infeed plan tools

Add explicit plan reads and strict partial updates through EditOperationParams.
Keep default flags visible and preserve undo and redo.
Pin the MCP contract and record the API decision.

Fixes #1847
